{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15816","headline":"初除拾遗酬丘二十二见寄 · 崔峒","name":"初除拾遗酬丘二十二见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江海久垂纶，朝衣忽挂身。\n丹墀初谒帝，白发免羞人。\n才愧文章士，名当谏诤臣。\n空余荐贤分，不敢负交亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔峒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15816.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15816","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}